{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q27108402","formula":"C₂₆H₄₀O₃","hill":"C26H40O3","elements":["H","C","O"],"composition":{"C":26.0,"H":40.0,"O":3.0},"names":{"en":"Testosterone enanthate","ru":"Тестостерона энантат"},"descriptions":{"en":"Testosterone enanthate is used in the treatment of low testosterone levels in men, including hormone therapy for transgender men. It is given by injection into muscle or subcutaneously usually once every one to four weeks. Side effects of testosterone enanthate include symptoms of masculinization like acne, increased hair growth, voice changes, and increased sexual desire.","ru":"Тестостерон энантат (фирменные названия Delatestryl, Testostroval, Testro LA, Andro LA, Durathate, Everone, Testrin, Andropository) — это сложный эфир тестостерона, который был синтезирован в 1952 году. Используется для лечения гипогонадизма, то есть природного недостатка тестостерона в организме. Это наиболее широко используемая форма тестостерона в андрогенной заместительной терапии."},"fame":9,"pubchemCid":9416,"mass":400.6,"charge":0,"smiles":"CCCCCCC(=O)O[C@H]1CC[C@@H]2[C@@]1(CC[C@H]3[C@H]2CCC4=CC(=O)CC[C@]34C)C","inchikey":"VOCBWIIFXDYGNZ-IXKNJLPQSA-N","iupac":"[(8R,9S,10R,13S,14S,17S)-10,13-dimethyl-3-oxo-1,2,6,7,8,9,11,12,14,15,16,17-dodecahydrocyclopenta[a]phenanthren-17-yl] heptanoate","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"9416","atoms":69,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-2.601,"y":0.068,"z":-0.095,"el":"O"},{"x":8.137,"y":0.753,"z":1.268,"el":"O"},{"x":-3.908,"y":-1.294,"z":1.23,"el":"O"},{"x":0.826,"y":-1.153,"z":0.142,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.142,"y":-0.023,"z":-0.257,"el":"C"},{"x":2.233,"y":-0.955,"z":-0.429,"el":"C"},{"x":2.807,"y":0.395,"z":0.106,"el":"C"},{"x":4.278,"y":0.675,"z":-0.392,"el":"C"},{"x":0.389,"y":1.288,"z":0.335,"el":"C"},